      "content": "thanks but the \"reach out\" thing doesn't really change the math of it. like, even if i'm \"supported,\" the person i was is still dead. the athlete is gone. i'm just an empty suit of armor now. it feels wrong to keep this thing going, you know? like i'm just wasting time and space by inhabiting a body that has no purpose left. it's more like a tragedy to watch this decline happen than to just let it go.",
